{"message":"feat(elab): admit inductive propositions with independent elimination checks\n\nSupport Prop-valued families and indexed recursive relations through source\ncandidate generation, ordinary K1 regeneration, and checker-owned recursor\nderivation. Infer small versus singleton/empty large elimination from\nactual field universes and exact result-index exposure. Independently check\nuniverse parameter layouts and K-target flags. Large existential witnesses\nremain impredicative but cannot be extracted through a data eliminator.\n\nConnect both universe layouts to source matching and recursor reduction.\nAdd seven independent forged-policy/cancellation tests, ten source tests,\nand an installed CLI example with fifteen commands and seven theorems.\nLocal five-package tests pass (1514 top-level tests including the preceding\ncapture repair). Scoped Clippy, workspace all-target compilation, and\nchanged-file formatting pass. Remote gates repeat before publication.\nNo upstream runtime, new axiom, dependency, unsafe code, or admission door.\nThis is not a pinned Prelude council run or full-language compatibility.","paths":["crates/fln-checker/src/admit.rs","crates/fln-checker/src/admit/uniform.rs","crates/fln-checker/tests/admit.rs","crates/fln-checker/tests/admit/propositions.rs","crates/fln-cli/tests/source_check.rs","crates/fln-elab/src/inductive.rs","crates/fln-elab/src/source/inductive.rs","crates/fln-elab/src/source/matching.rs","crates/fln-elab/src/source/reduce.rs","crates/fln/tests/source_inductive.rs","crates/fln/tests/source_propositions.rs","docs/NATIVE_INDEXED.md","docs/NATIVE_PROPOSITIONS.md","examples/native_propositions.lean"],"sha256":"044847191da7abf7245646887d3742325c71c6792ecef4e41226c56f2608afbe","base_blobs":{"crates/fln-checker/src/admit.rs":"54e2c23a4a36fe1e2ce3a3fb7b1d0de818face8a","crates/fln-checker/src/admit/uniform.rs":"9f3274d65bfe55b8ff07f17ae29c6fe6387ae159","crates/fln-checker/tests/admit.rs":"d68e224902e677f6253f1eee57d7656abeb4f